{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The Game:\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing a princess... old fashioned maybe, but that\u2019s been Billy\u2019s obsession ever since he was a kid, spending endless hours binge watching old Dinkey films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years passed. Billy grew up. No job. No studies. No friends. Nothing but his craving for a princess-rescue adventure. Risky? Dangerous? Sure. But also\u2026 potentially lucrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, you must <strong>choose a princess (or prince) to rescue</strong>. If you can\u2019t decide, just follow your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might even grant you a small symbolic gift to begin your quest\u2014along with a peculiar request: bring them some cursed object they long for. A tote bag, bubble tea, cigarettes, glue\u2026 mundane things, but cursed nonetheless. Each of these objects comes with a peculiar perk or curse you\u2019ll have to endure throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in near-darkness, armed with little more than a <strong>basic weapon</strong> and sheer stubbornness. You are weak. Near-sighted. Totally dependent on <strong>gear</strong>:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes</strong> (precious few, acumulables,). (+40)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/e34b0352de9984fb97fc1aa00976f516.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Adds one jump to your Weapon Lightning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/c0b98d0a12e32f02ea50d39fb17fd5ab.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Heals you &quot;X&quot; each second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/82d23814545ac170a70015e5377e71ec.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Poison duration. +1s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/a12e51262fd520485c4264a0cdb1658f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Shows enemies healtbar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/be97df8dc8157de98645e5ae44408c3e.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Increase &quot;critical hit&quot; chance +X%.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/bb78f23b76aa1f773d1558ca73140a7f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Freeze enemy +1s when hit with Orbit Ball.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0<strong>&amp; Magic</strong> (manual and automatic, upgradeable up to <strong>seven levels</strong>.). (12)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/37d40573f4d823164621012efb1ce773.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Boss Hunter&quot;: </strong>Automatic. Finds closest boss and damage it.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/ecc3265bc1092350f5d159df90ffbc13.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Wall&quot;:</strong>\u00a0 Creates a temporal wall that proteccs you from enemies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/0a0763c689d77e85e60d2459c719fe33.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Poison Area&quot;</strong>: Applies poison to enemies in area of explode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/fa9f8d0047f61ce795fe3906472e796f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Default Gun&quot;</strong>: Simple. But powerfull when upgraded.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/513cc7650a33d631f7cdfce67db13c08.webp?t=1760646567\" width=40 height=40 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Shield&quot;:</strong> Proteccs you when active.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cursed objects:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/5768b29f1e3268af690f150b90673d49.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Ashtray&quot;:</strong> Halves your total max health.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/38fb66ab4d2e408860926f5b460494f5.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Cigarretes&quot;:</strong> Reduce &quot;X&quot; health each 10 seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/9087b4bf576a24ce9634053937adaa7e.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Tote Bag&quot;:</strong> Increases store prices each time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/13f4e3f2b79de90bce97f3e8a80f59be.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Wedding Dress&quot;:</strong> Reduces &quot;X%&quot; your speed.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the endless waves. Face the bosses. Defeat the castle. Discover 3 misteries. Rescue your chosen royal and deliver the cursed trinkets. Then unlock one of <strong>twelve or more endings</strong>\u2014each low-budget, unconfirmed, and guaranteed to disappoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*All of it wrapped in dozens of collectible curated\u00a0<strong>classical music tracks</strong>, with enough baroque bangers that slap harder than Billy\u2019s father\u2019s emotional distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/cfc8c7c08d19b84c3fb307465163be87.webp?t=1760646567\" width=224 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>About:</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello. You still here? I've made this game alone, at night, hearing people getting asaulted on the street because I live in a shitty neighbourhood.    <br>It's my first game, so if you buy it and then you return it.. that would not be ok. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/9950a7afa248cb8a80bd95c6e6a96d3e.poster.avif?t=1760646567\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/9950a7afa248cb8a80bd95c6e6a96d3e.webm?t=1760646567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/9950a7afa248cb8a80bd95c6e6a96d3e.mp4?t=1760646567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019050?t=1760646567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/e0b6f3d61bd459e72a6353017103cc47053a0a2f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760646567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/7c536c7163207ed22d498ba06279c4eff5bd010c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760646567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/7c536c7163207ed22d498ba06279c4eff5bd010c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760646567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The Game:\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescuing a princess... old fashioned maybe, but that\u2019s been Billy\u2019s obsession ever since he was a kid, spending endless hours binge watching old Dinkey films.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years passed. Billy grew up. No job. No studies. No friends. Nothing but his craving for a princess-rescue adventure. Risky? Dangerous? Sure. But also\u2026 potentially lucrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, you must <strong>choose a princess (or prince) to rescue</strong>. If you can\u2019t decide, just follow your heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might even grant you a small symbolic gift to begin your quest\u2014along with a peculiar request: bring them some cursed object they long for. A tote bag, bubble tea, cigarettes, glue\u2026 mundane things, but cursed nonetheless. Each of these objects comes with a peculiar perk or curse you\u2019ll have to endure throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin in near-darkness, armed with little more than a <strong>basic weapon</strong> and sheer stubbornness. You are weak. Near-sighted. Totally dependent on <strong>gear</strong>:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Runes</strong> (precious few, acumulables,). (+40)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/e34b0352de9984fb97fc1aa00976f516.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Adds one jump to your Weapon Lightning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/c0b98d0a12e32f02ea50d39fb17fd5ab.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Heals you &quot;X&quot; each second.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/82d23814545ac170a70015e5377e71ec.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Poison duration. +1s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/a12e51262fd520485c4264a0cdb1658f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Shows enemies healtbar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/be97df8dc8157de98645e5ae44408c3e.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Increase &quot;critical hit&quot; chance +X%.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/bb78f23b76aa1f773d1558ca73140a7f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Freeze enemy +1s when hit with Orbit Ball.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>\u00a0<strong>&amp; Magic</strong> (manual and automatic, upgradeable up to <strong>seven levels</strong>.). (12)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/37d40573f4d823164621012efb1ce773.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Boss Hunter&quot;: </strong>Automatic. Finds closest boss and damage it.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/ecc3265bc1092350f5d159df90ffbc13.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Wall&quot;:</strong>\u00a0 Creates a temporal wall that proteccs you from enemies.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/0a0763c689d77e85e60d2459c719fe33.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Poison Area&quot;</strong>: Applies poison to enemies in area of explode.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/fa9f8d0047f61ce795fe3906472e796f.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Default Gun&quot;</strong>: Simple. But powerfull when upgraded.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/513cc7650a33d631f7cdfce67db13c08.webp?t=1760646567\" width=40 height=40 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Shield&quot;:</strong> Proteccs you when active.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cursed objects:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/5768b29f1e3268af690f150b90673d49.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Ashtray&quot;:</strong> Halves your total max health.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/38fb66ab4d2e408860926f5b460494f5.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Cigarretes&quot;:</strong> Reduce &quot;X&quot; health each 10 seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/9087b4bf576a24ce9634053937adaa7e.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Tote Bag&quot;:</strong> Increases store prices each time.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/13f4e3f2b79de90bce97f3e8a80f59be.webp?t=1760646567\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0<strong>&quot;Wedding Dress&quot;:</strong> Reduces &quot;X%&quot; your speed.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>&amp; more!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the endless waves. Face the bosses. Defeat the castle. Discover 3 misteries. Rescue your chosen royal and deliver the cursed trinkets. Then unlock one of <strong>twelve or more endings</strong>\u2014each low-budget, unconfirmed, and guaranteed to disappoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*All of it wrapped in dozens of collectible curated\u00a0<strong>classical music tracks</strong>, with enough baroque bangers that slap harder than Billy\u2019s father\u2019s emotional distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019050/extras/cfc8c7c08d19b84c3fb307465163be87.webp?t=1760646567\" width=224 height=32 /></span></p><h2 cla